<title>USA: Chad Therapeutics sees lower Q4 sales.</title>
<headline>Chad Therapeutics sees lower Q4 sales.</headline>
<dateline>CHATSWORTH, Calif. 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chad Therapeutics Inc said Monday preliminary sales for the fourth quarter, ended March 31, were $5,078,000, a decrease of 2 percent from the same quarter last year.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement sales for the fiscal year rose to $26,162,000, 28 percent above the previous year.</p>
<p>Complete audited operating results will be released at the end of May.</p>
</text>
